  "notes": "Surmai travel board. Signature look: muted slate-blue (#6b7a99) 80px icon rail with the active item as a white rounded tile with shadow; light-gray canvas with white 8px-radius outlined cards; all text in Verdana giving a plain, system-app feel. Stats cards are three-column rows (category, count, duration with gray 'Avg.:' subline) closed by a hairline divider and a total row; Expense card uses a labelled divider 'Totals per Currency'. The year strip is a scrollable pill row whose selection is reflected in the URL and re-scopes every widget including map pins. Map is a default Leaflet/OSM map; pins open popups with city, region and a link to the trip. Footer is position:fixed and overlaps content in the full-page capture. Notification bell navigates to the profile Notifications tab rather than opening a panel."
